title: UAC Bypass via fodhelper.exe Registry Hijack
id: 85fc7fd4-b9f5-4ac6-9f03-aeac2ac937ba
status: experimental
description: Detects the fodhelper ms-settings UAC bypass registry hijack.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/002/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: registry_set
detection:
  selection:
    TargetObject|contains: '\Software\Classes\ms-settings\shell\open\command'
  selection_delegate:
    TargetObject|endswith: '\ms-settings\shell\open\command\DelegateExecute'
  condition: selection or selection_delegate
fields:
  - TargetObject
  - Details
  - Image
falsepositives:
  - Rare legitimate customization of ms-settings handlers
level: high
tags:
  - attack.privilege_escalation
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1548.002
